unit USBBulkTransferMode;

{
  Notes.

  Bulk mode is unbuffered (and cannot be used in Short Read Modes where
  packets smaller than expected are allowed).

  The mode is master requests - slave replies, but ironically read must
  be done before write (in order to set up the buffer) otherwise the
  slave device could (and probably will) respond before the read is set
  up, and because it is unbuffered, will simply be lost, meaning that the
  read will fail.
}


